  "base_commit": "aa84a7929a1054435eb0812a2b3b17b27c1d5392",
  "implementation": [
    "Six additive C ABI symbols; existing ABI version and structure layouts unchanged",
    "Synchronous callbacks on calling thread; native algorithm invoked once",
    "Owned immutable C result with query-only metadata and atomic buffer validation",
