    "C request validation before callbacks, aliased outputs and capacity overflow",
    "No callback rerun on result queries; unused tails and failed outputs preserved",
    "Nested RFModel calls and copied request unchanged by caller mutations",
    "Mixed real/log/integer known minimizer and deterministic replay",
    "Evaluation/iteration/cancel/failure/no-finite/numerical-resolution stops",
    "UTF-8 diagnostic truncation, fatal Python exceptions and cancellation hook errors",
    "All LC network evaluations compared with independent impedance reference"
